        "content": "📦 AGGREGATE\nMerges the 8 weeks into a single array.\nNeeded so Claude sees the full history and\ndetects trend, instead of analyzing week by week.\n\n📦 AGGREGATE (ES)\nJunta las 8 semanas en un solo array.\nNecesario para que Claude vea el histórico completo\ny detecte tendencia, no analice semana por semana.",
